--
--   Description
-- 
-- The receive functionality is tested for accepting jumbo 
-- frames in 100 mode of operation
-- 
-- THIS TEST CHECKS THE PACKT BUFFER OPERATION WITH 2K MEMORY SIZE
--
--      RAM size   Max packets  LUT size    Data buffer size  
--        1024         16         256 bytes     768 bytes       
--        2048         32         512 bytes    1536 bytes       
--        4096         64        1024 bytes    3072 bytes       
--        8192        128        2048 bytes    6144 bytes       
-- 
-- Functional Coverage
-- -------------------
-- · Ensures that the GEM can receive jumbo frames in 
--     100 mode of operation. 
-- · Ensures that the GEM can properly deal with jumbo frames 
--     that have errors in them in 100 mode of operation.
-- 
-- Detailed Test Description
-- -------------------------
-- 
-- Receiving Jumbo Frames in 100 mode:
-- 1. Receive a jumbo frame that is 1000 bytes long.
-- 2. Receive a jumbo frame that is 1537 bytes long.
-- 3. Receive a jumbo frame that is 1536 bytes long.
-- 4. Check the status and statistics registers and ensure that the above 
--     operations were handled properly.
-- 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

